// See rnd_seed0/rnd_seed1 in chk/root/wide.id: each seed fixture replays one
// more draw than the last, so a case that enters the rnd chain mid-way still
// sees the exact draw the full chain would have produced at that point.
rnd_seed2() {
  rnd_seed1();
  rnd_next();
} return void;
():() then calls rnd_seed1:[1]
():() then calls rnd_next:()
